# The Signal Voter Guide

Independent, nonpartisan 50-state voter guide by Anand Sinha.

## Purpose

A 50-state, 5-race reference (Governor, US Senate, US House, State Senate,
State House) built on Vote411-style address/browse flow. Reads live from a
Google Sheet backend. Does not endorse or recommend candidates.

Live at: https://anandsinhausa.com/voterguide

## Files

- `index.html` — the site. GitHub Pages serves this automatically for the
  `/voterguide` path.

## Note

This README exists partly to keep this folder from disappearing. GitHub only
tracks files, not empty folders — if `index.html` is ever deleted without a
replacement uploaded in the same commit, this folder (and this README) will
be deleted too, since nothing would be left inside it to track. Keep at least
one file here at all times.
